%   \item We will implement features such as pulse generation, pulse frequency measurement, closed-loop motor speed control, and network communication.
  \item We will implement more and more tasks, building the complexity and 
  efficiency of the real-time code. 
  \item We will squeeze more and more performance out of the target chip
  by adding tasks as the quarter goes on.
  \item We will continue to maintain hard real time performance.
  \item Challenge yourself with extensions in the final project.
