Lab Topics (approximate):

\begin{enumerate}
    \item Development Env. Setup, flash and LED
    \item Precision timing, reading sensors, closing loops.
    \item Priority based scheduling, I/O to a device, Wireless comms.
    \item Advanced scheduling (writing your own scheduler), dual-core computing with synchronization.
\end{enumerate}
 
